:grid-cols-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>XSTO M4B Power Wheelchair</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>25.55V 15.5Ah Lithium Battery</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Battery Charger</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Joystick Controller</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Bluetooth Remote Control</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>User Manual</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Tool Kit</li></ul></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-delivery" id="_R_hl_-panel-delivery" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground"><p>Free UK mainland delivery on all XSTO wheelchairs. Typically arrives within 3–4 working days.</p><p>Warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts, and 1 year on the battery. Bentech Medical Ltd manages all UK warranty claims as the official distributor.</p></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm"><a href="/pages/returns" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Read our returns policy</a> · <a href="/pages/warranty" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Warranty information</a></p></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-faq" id="_R_hl_-panel-faq" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-soft"><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Why choose the XSTO M4B?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B builds on the award-winning M4 platform with an improved integrated folding footrest for easier transfers and new front suspension for a smoother ride. It keeps self-balancing control, electric height adjustment (347–650 mm), 10° slope capability, and app-based remote control.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How does the M4B differ from the M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B adds a new front-wheel design and integrated folding pedals. Weight without battery is 55.5 kg (vs 51.5 kg on the M4). Core performance — 115 kg capacity, 15 km range, 6 km/h top speed, and 10° max slope — matches the M4.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the M4B&#x27;s maximum weight capacity?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B supports up to 115 kg (254 lbs) and maintains stable performance within this limit for safe operation.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How long does the M4B battery last on a single charge?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Under typical daily use (regular speed, moderate terrain), the standard 25.55V 15.5Ah battery provides up to 15 km (9.3 miles) per charge. Full recharge takes approximately 4 hours.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4B be taken on flights?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B includes a standard 25.55V 15.5Ah removable battery. For air travel, a compatible lower-capacity airline battery (sold separately) is recommended. While that battery meets most airline requirements, please confirm with your airline before flying.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How soon can I receive the M4B after ordering?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What warranty is included with the M4B?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I claim VAT relief on the M4B?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4B VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout.</p></details></div></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-videos" id="_R_hl_-panel-videos" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div 